This guide is part of the [Drizzle](/drizzle) stack docs.

Capture exceptions, track performance, and identify users with a provider-agnostic monitoring system. Built-in Sentry support with an extensible architecture for custom providers.

Read the [Monitoring Overview](./monitoring/overview) to get started.
